.{u} out (Std.Rxo.Iterator.upperBound.{u} (Std.Iterators.Iter.internalState.{u} it))))","unsafe":false,"value":222,"source":{"code":"theorem Iterator.isPlausibleIndirectOutput_iff\n    [UpwardEnumerable α] [LT α] [DecidableLT α]\n    [LawfulUpwardEnumerable α] [LawfulUpwardEnumerableLT α]\n    {it : Iter (α := Rxo.Iterator α) α} {out : α} :\n    it.IsPlausibleIndirectOutput out ↔\n      ∃ n, it.internalState.next.bind (succMany? n ·) = some out ∧\n        out < it.internalState.upperBound := by\n  simp only [Iter.isPlausibleIndirectOutput_iff_isPlausibleIndirectOutput_toIterM,\n    Monadic.isPlausibleIndirectOutput_iff, Iter.toIterM]","start":1006,"end":1014},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}